	"Author": "erzvolnes",
	"AuthorLabel": "crunchy",
	"Description": "A few recolours of the vanilla horse. Mostly made for my own use, but figured I'd upload in case anyone else wants to use them.\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />Has 6 recolours, shown in this order: White, Black, Black with bald face, Grullo, Flaxen Chestnut, and Chestnut. More colours may be added if and when I have time.\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />These recolours do not change the original silhouette, style or animation of the horse. It is largely a 1-1 recolour of the existing sprite. The chestnut variant has a slightly different saddle colour, but the rest are all the vanilla colour.\n<br />\n<br />The files are all included in a single download for ease of use, but this may change in the future if I add more options.\u00A0\n<br />\n<br />[b]Installation:\n<br />[/b]\n<br />[list]\n<br />[*]Make sure you have both SMAPI and Content Patcher\u00A0\n<br />[*]Download this mod &amp; unzip it.\u00A0\n<br />[*]Inside the main folder, select the horse variant you want to add to your game.\u00A0\n<br />[*]Copy the desired folder into your StardewValley/Mods folder.\n<br />[/list][list]\n<br />[*]Launch the game.\u00A0\n<br />[*]Done!\n<br />[/list]\u00A0\n<br />Stable in ingame screenshots is my [url=https://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/43627]Slightly Nicer Stable.[/url]",
